sequenceDiagram
  actor PM as Product Manager
  participant Cl as Client (Claude / editor / Control Plane)
  participant Co as Coconut MCP Connector
  participant Cx as Context layer
  participant AI as Model

  PM->>Cl: "Draft the Q3 spec / prep my review"
  Cl->>Co: Request context (permission-aware)
  Co->>Cx: Fetch relevant context (5 layers)
  Cx-->>Co: Owner-approved, current context
  Co-->>Cl: Inject context
  Cl->>AI: Prompt + context
  AI-->>PM: Draft with full picture
  PM->>Cl: Edit / propose change
  Cl->>Cx: Open Task / Proposal
  Note over Cx: Owner reviews, approves, propagates
  Cx-->>Co: Jobs enrich & re-verify on schedule
